over TV)

7
00:00:16,035 --> 00:00:18,065
(Raj:)Man, I'm worn out.
I know.

8
00:00:18,070 --> 00:00:21,040
(Howard:)Imagine if we were
actually moving.

9
00:00:21,040 --> 00:00:25,510
(Raj:)No, it's just, ever since I
