with the woman you love.

16
00:00:40,459 --> 00:00:42,259
(Howard:)I guess I am lucky.

17
00:00:42,261 --> 00:00:45,661
(Raj:)You are, because
dating two women,

18
00:00:45,664 --> 00:00:48,264
(Raj:)I mean, I can't even remember

19
